    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d310-a7">

                <pb facs="0500" n="428" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg428"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.—Exhibit B.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Territory of Arizona</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">County of Pima, ss:</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the sheriff, constable, marshal, or
                        policeman in this Territory:</hi></p>
                <p>Complaint upon oath having been this day made before me, a justice of the peace
                    in and for the above county, by Hugh Farley, that the offense of murder has been
                    committed, and accusing Ju, Nashi, Geronimo, and others, whose full and true
                    names are unknown, thereof:</p>
                <p>You are therefore commanded by the Territory of Arizona forthwith to arrest the
                    above-named Ju, Nashi, Geronimo, and others, whose full and true names are
                    unknown, and bring them before me forthwith at my office in the town of Tucson,
                    or, in case of my absence or inability to act, before the nearest and most
                    accessible magistrate within this county.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given under my hand <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-04-27">this 27th day of April, A. D. 1882</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>WILLIAM J. OSBORN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Justice of the Peace in
                            and for said county.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
